 "notes": "1926 flats, five storeys. Tall olive-green clapboard ground storey with a round-arched entry at centre, a grilled shop window left, a ribbon window and shopfront right; cream stucco uppers with five splayed bays trimmed olive and cream (relief panels not modelled), two railed steel fire escapes (left of centre, right), cream cornice. Rework r-eddy: darker olive base storey, olive sashes, cartouche plaques in the bay spandrels, white fire escapes, dark canopy over the arch (hand.py). Tint lift (2026-10-02): paint tints lifted toward the sunlit paint (t' = 1-(1-t)k); brick tints converted to target / kit colour. GroundBand lift (2026-10-03): groundBand tint #6f7a4c -> #8c9570 (same rule as walls; it was missed by the first colour pass).",
